798:
The superintendent of streets is hereby authorized:
(1) To designate and maintain crosswalks by means of appropriate devices, marks or lines upon the surface of the roadway;
(2) To establish safety zones of such kind and character and at such places as he may deem necessary for the protection of pedestrians;
